OL,3,GNEWSAArts director leaving Corby role
OL,4,Aafter eight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long-serving arts director is set to
OL,7,Fleave his role to take up the same
OL,8,Fposition at a neighbouring venue.
OL,10,FJoe Flavin has resigned from The Core
OL,11,Fat Corby Cube, in Northamptonshire,
OL,12,Fafter eight years to become director at
OL,13,FThe Cresset in Peterborough.
OL,15,F"Working in Corby has been an absolute
OL,16,Fpleasure, the whole of the UK and
OL,17,FEurope seems to have a cultural
OL,18,Frepresentation in Corby and as an Irish
OL,19,Fperson moving here, I was welcomed with
OL,20,Fopen arms," he said.
