OL,3,GNEWSAArts director leaving Corby role
OL,4,Aafter eight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlavin confirmed he would remain part
OL,7,Fof the team behind Corby's bid to
OL,8,Fbecome the UK's first Town of Culture
OL,9,Fin 2028.
